      "text": "lies a world of sunlight, coral, and treasure."
    },
    {
      "at": 11.0,
      "text": "Take the helm of your very own submarine."
    },
    {
      "at": 20.7,
      "text": "But you are not alone down here."
    },
    {
      "at": 28.9,
      "text": "Blast enemy subs. Grab the loot."
    },
    {
      "at": 33.0,
      "text": "Bolt on bigger guns, torpedoes, and missiles."
    },
    {
      "at": 50.25,
      "text": "And when the sunlight fades..."
    },
    {
